  title: Retention order
  category: ARCHIVE / 03-02 / SYSTEM RECORD
  body: 'ARCHIVE STATUS: PENDING REMOVAL


    The system lists these records as
    residual noise. Their dates, names and accounts have not been reconciled with
    the maintenance report.


    A clean index can be produced by deleting disputed
    entries. The events themselves cannot be deleted.'
